                "next_start_s": 56.46,
                "gap_s": 35.62,
                "text": "The framework is called MAC."
              },
              {
                "kind": "GAP",
                "cue_idx": 5,
                "start_s": 79.51,
                "next_start_s": 105.77,
                "gap_s": 26.26,
                "text": "Commitment — show up, regardless of how you feel."
              }
            ]
          },
          "ffprobe_duration_s": null,
          "whisper_segments": [
            {
              "start_s": 0.24,
              "end_s": 2.56,
              "text": "Hey, welcome to Relentless."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 2.56,
              "end_s": 7.04,
              "text": "Before we do anything, I want to explain what you actually signed up for, because it's"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 7.04,
              "end_s": 9.24,
              "text": "not what most people think."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 9.24,
              "end_s": 11.64,
              "text": "This is not a meditation app."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 11.64,
              "end_s": 17.08,
              "text": "This is not positive thinking, or visualization boards, or motivational quotes."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 17.08,
              "end_s": 21.04,
              "text": "This is real mental performance training, and there's a huge difference."
            }
          ],
          "whisper_segment_count": 6
        },
        {
          "seg_index": 2,
          "audio_files": [
            "lesson_01/lesson_01_seg_03.mp3"
          ],
          "mp3_path": "C:\\Users\\rkuma\\Downloads\\RELENTLESS\\CONTENT\\LESSON 1\\L1S2.mp3",
          "mp3_exists": true,
          "current_total_audio_seconds": 26.0,
          "current_cue_count": 4,
          "audit": {
            "issue_count": 2,
            "issues": [
              {
                "kind": "MULTI",
                "cue_idx": 0,
                "start_s": 0.0,
                "n_sentences": 2,
                "text": "Got your answer? Remember it."
              },
              {
                "kind": "MULTI",
                "cue_idx": 2,
                "start_s": 9.0,
                "n_sentences": 3,
                "text": "Go ahead and hit the journal. One question. Be honest."
              }
            ]
          },
          "ffprobe_duration_s": null,
          "whisper_segments": [
            {
              "start_s": 0.0,
              "end_s": 4.8,
              "text": "The framework behind every single lesson in this app is called M-A-C,"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 5.52,
              "end_s": 12.56,
              "text": "mindfulness, acceptance, commitment. It was introduced in 2001 and is the most studied"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 12.56,
              "end_s": 18.64,
              "text": "mental performance approach for athletes specifically, not just soldiers or executives, athletes."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 20.08,
              "end_s": 27.04,
              "text": "And here's what each one means in plain terms. Mindfulness is the ability to notice what"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 27.04,
              "end_s": 33.84,
              "text": "your mind is doing right now and redirect it. That's it. Not clearing your mind,"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 33.84,
              "end_s": 39.76,
              "text": "not thinking about nothing, just noticing where your attention is and choosing where it goes."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 41.84,
              "end_s": 44.96,
              "text": "Acceptance is the willingness to feel uncomfortable,"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 45.68,
              "end_s": 50.8,
              "text": "like nervous, scared or doubtful, without treating it like an emergency."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 51.92,
              "end_s": 56.24,
              "text": "You don't eliminate the feeling. You stop letting it run your decisions."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 58.51,
              "end_s": 64.59,
              "text": "Commitment is showing up for who you said you are, regardless of how you feel on any given day."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 65.39,
              "end_s": 70.91,
              "text": "Not motivation, motivation comes and goes, but commitment is a decision."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 72.75,
              "end_s": 79.07,
              "text": "Together, those three things are what every elite performer is doing. Whether they have a name for"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 79.07,
              "end_s": 86.83,
              "text": "it or not, but now you have the name. Take a second and think about which one you need most."
            }
          ],
          "whisper_segment_count": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    "2": {
      "voiceovers": [
        {
          "seg_index": 1,
          "audio_files": [
