          "whisper_segments": [
            {
              "start_s": 1.26,
              "end_s": 7.74,
              "text": "Day three. Before we go any further, we need a starting point. Think of this like measuring"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 7.74,
              "end_s": 12.9,
              "text": "your vertical before a training block. We're not judging where you are. We're creating"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 12.9,
              "end_s": 19.06,
              "text": "a number we can compare against again on day 30. So I'm going to walk you through three"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 19.06,
              "end_s": 25.94,
              "text": "questions. One for each pillar. Mindfulness, acceptance, commitment. Score yourself"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 25.94,
              "end_s": 33.02,
              "text": "honestly from one to ten. One means it's a major problem for you right now and ten means"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 33.02,
              "end_s": 39.26,
              "text": "you've got this locked in. There's no right answer. It's just where you are today."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 39.26,
              "end_s": 44.78,
              "text": "So the screen is going to show you each question one at a time. You'll have 30 seconds per"
            },
            {
