              {
                "kind": "MULTI",
                "cue_idx": 7,
                "start_s": 70.18,
                "n_sentences": 2,
                "text": "On your screen you're going to see a few examples. Then write two or three of your own."
              }
            ]
          },
          "ffprobe_duration_s": null,
          "whisper_segments": [
            {
              "start_s": 1.04,
              "end_s": 6.0,
              "text": "Day four, you've got your baseline, you know where you're starting."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 6.0,
              "end_s": 13.5,
              "text": "Now I want to ask you something most coaches never ask, who are you as a competitor?"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 13.5,
              "end_s": 19.16,
              "text": "Now when you want to achieve, now what your stats say, who are you?"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 19.16,
              "end_s": 23.84,
              "text": "Right now when you step onto the field, the court, the track."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 23.84,
              "end_s": 26.08,
              "text": "Here's why this matters."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 26.08,
              "end_s": 32.36,
              "text": "Research on identity-based motivation shows that athletes who compete from a clear sense"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 32.36,
              "end_s": 37.68,
              "text": "of who they are, outperform athletes who compete from outcome."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 37.68,
              "end_s": 44.84,
              "text": "The difference between I want to win and I am the kind of athlete who doesn't quit."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 44.84,
              "end_s": 51.32,
              "text": "That's not just words, it's how your brain decides what to do when things get hard."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 51.32,
              "end_s": 55.92,
              "text": "Today, you're going to write your identity."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 55.92,
              "end_s": 64.52,
              "text": "Intense, specific, behavioral, not I want to be more confident, that's a wish."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 64.52,
              "end_s": 70.88,
              "text": "I am an athlete who compete through discomfort, that's an identity."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 70.88,
              "end_s": 75.04,
              "text": "On your screen, you're going to see a few examples to get you started."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 75.04,
              "end_s": 80.76,
              "text": "Then I want you to write two or three of your own, take the full time, these matter."
            }
          ],
          "whisper_segment_count": 14
