            {
              "start_s": 0.46,
              "end_s": 5.7,
              "text": "Hey, welcome to day six of Relentless. Here's something most athletes don't know"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 6.66,
              "end_s": 11.18,
              "text": "Anxiety shows up in your body before it shows up in your thoughts a tight jaw"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 11.9,
              "end_s": 17.1,
              "text": "Ray shoulders clinch fists shallow breathing look you felt it all"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 17.78,
              "end_s": 23.18,
              "text": "Before a big competition and you probably had no idea what to do with it. So today we fixed that"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 23.86,
              "end_s": 26.22,
              "text": "We're gonna scan your body from head to toe"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 26.94,
              "end_s": 32.1,
              "text": "Find where your storing tension and release it on our exhales. Not force it out"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 32.34,
