              "start_s": 35.43,
              "end_s": 39.59,
              "text": "Are you laying down?"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 39.59,
              "end_s": 48.03,
              "text": "Give yourself nothing but pure focus and attention around your head, around your hair,"
            },
