              "start_s": 48.03,
              "end_s": 50.71,
              "text": "your forehead, around your eyes."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 50.71,
              "end_s": 54.79,
              "text": "Do you notice any tension?"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 54.79,
              "end_s": 66.18,
              "text": "As you focus on your head and only your head, take a deep breath in and just release."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 66.18,
              "end_s": 74.3,
              "text": "Focus on your jaw, your neck, your throat, athletes carry a lot of tension here."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 74.3,
              "end_s": 86.8,
              "text": "I need you to breathe in, slowly exhale and simply release, relax and let go."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 86.8,
              "end_s": 91.8,
              "text": "Take your attention to your shoulders, your upper back."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 91.8,
              "end_s": 92.8,
              "text": "Are they raised?"
