              "start_s": 92.8,
              "end_s": 95.32,
              "text": "Are they tense?"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 95.32,
              "end_s": 98.6,
              "text": "Drop them and completely relax."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 98.6,
              "end_s": 105.94,
              "text": "One slow breath in and slowly release."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 105.94,
              "end_s": 119.5,
              "text": "Take your attention to your chest, your lungs, breathe all the way in, release, relax and"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 119.5,
              "end_s": 123.34,
              "text": "let go."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 123.34,
              "end_s": 127.25,
              "text": "Take your attention to your arms."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 127.25,
              "end_s": 132.57,
              "text": "Focus on the nerves, going all the way down to your hands, your fingers."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 132.57,
              "end_s": 140.61,
              "text": "Let your hands completely relax, unclench your fists and just completely rest heavy."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 140.61,
              "end_s": 147.95,
              "text": "Keep working on that breath, release, relax and let go."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 147.95,
              "end_s": 152.43,
              "text": "Take your attention to your core, your stomach."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 152.43,
              "end_s": 155.19,
              "text": "This is where nerves live."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 155.19,
              "end_s": 159.31,
              "text": "Just breathe into that core, breathe into that stomach."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 159.31,
              "end_s": 168.28,
              "text": "Let it expand, then release, relax and let go."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 168.28,
              "end_s": 175.14,
              "text": "Focus on your hips, your legs, your feet."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 175.14,
              "end_s": 180.1,
              "text": "Every sensation you feel, everything is right where it needs to be."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 180.1,
              "end_s": 188.5,
              "text": "Your total undivided attention, simply focusing on your lower extremities, all the way to the"
            },
            {
              "start_s": 188.5,
              "end_s": 192.82,
              "text": "floor or wherever you are, laying down in a comfortable place."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 192.82,
              "end_s": 196.54,
              "text": "Just feel the ground underneath you."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 196.54,
              "end_s": 204.6,
              "text": "Keep working that breath and just release, relax and let go."
            },
            {
              "start_s": 204.6,
              "end_s": 209.76,
              "text": "Now just zoom out for a second and see your whole body for what it is."
            },
